{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20162","headline":"蜘蛛讽 · 孟郊","name":"蜘蛛讽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万类皆有性，各各禀天和。\n蚕身与汝身，汝身何太讹。\n蚕身不爲己，汝身不爲佗。\n蚕丝爲衣裳，汝丝爲网罗。\n济物几无功，害物日已多。\n百虫虽切恨，其将奈尔何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}